# Third-party source material: retained locally for research, NOT redistributable (same convention as
# Reference/Materials/books/ and to-be-integrated/books/ in the repo root .gitignore).
# Public-domain and CC-licensed items are listed in source_manifest.csv with their license class;
# the text copies themselves are still kept out of git so one rule covers everything.
source_texts/*
!source_texts/.gitkeep
Tier_C_Dropbox/*
!Tier_C_Dropbox/.gitkeep
!Tier_C_Dropbox/README.md
